WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.979
Oliver made a scary mask.

2
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:09.472
"Everyone will be afraid of me!" he said happily.

3
00:00:09.473 --> 00:00:15.957
First he tried to scare Harry and Emmy.

4
00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:18.541
But it didn't work.

5
00:00:18.542 --> 00:00:22.777
"Nice mask, Oliver," Harry said.

6
00:00:22.778 --> 00:00:27.785
"Pretty colors!" Emmy said.

7
00:00:27.786 --> 00:00:31.865
Next Oliver tried to scare Dad and Mom.

8
00:00:31.866 --> 00:00:35.918
"Hello, Oliver!" Dad gave him a hug.

9
00:00:35.919 --> 00:00:39.314
"Time for dinner, Oliver," Mom said.

10
00:00:39.315 --> 00:00:44.966
Oliver sighed.

11
00:00:44.967 --> 00:00:48.575
After dinner Oliver put on his mask again.

12
00:00:48.576 --> 00:00:52.241
He brought Rover outside to play.

13
00:00:52.242 --> 00:00:55.533
"Boo!" Oliver tried to scare Rover.

14
00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:59.850
But Rover just licked the mask.

15
00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:02.127
Oliver frowned.

16
00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:06.261
"This mask isn't scary at all," he said.

17
00:01:06.262 --> 00:01:11.417
Oliver tossed the mask on the ground.

18
00:01:11.418 --> 00:01:16.190
Soon it was almost dark.

19
00:01:16.191 --> 00:01:22.364
"Time to go inside," Oliver said.

20
00:01:22.365 --> 00:01:25.047
He went to the front door.

21
00:01:25.048 --> 00:01:28.513
It was locked.

22
00:01:28.514 --> 00:01:31.102
Oliver went to the back door.

23
00:01:31.103 --> 00:01:33.744
It was locked.

24
00:01:33.745 --> 00:01:36.330
He looked through a window.

25
00:01:36.331 --> 00:01:42.428
Everyone was watching TV.

26
00:01:42.429 --> 00:01:46.074
"Let me in!" Oliver cried.

27
00:01:46.075 --> 00:01:50.045
But no one could hear him over the TV.

28
00:01:50.046 --> 00:01:54.127
Oliver waved his arms wildly.

29
00:01:54.128 --> 00:01:57.984
But no one could see him in the dark.

30
00:01:57.985 --> 00:02:01.689
Oliver pressed his nose against the window.

31
00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.091
He knocked loudly.

32
00:02:04.092 --> 00:02:08.773
"Ahh!" everyone screamed.

33
00:02:08.774 --> 00:02:14.786
"Whew! It's Oliver!" Emmy said.

34
00:02:14.787 --> 00:02:17.708
Emmy opened the door.

35
00:02:17.709 --> 00:02:21.360
"You scared us!" she said.

36
00:02:21.361 --> 00:02:23.934
Oliver grinned.

37
00:02:23.935 --> 00:02:30.259
"And I wasn't even wearing my mask!"

